    <title>Privacy Policy — Home Mend</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #2c3e50;
            background: #f5f7f6;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2E7D5A 0%, #4CAF88 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.4rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .header .app-name {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            opacity: 0.95;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .header .tagline {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            opacity: 0.85;
            margin-top: 6px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 40px;
        }

        .effective-date {
            background: #e8f5ef;
            border-left: 4px solid #2E7D5A;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #2E7D5A;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #2E7D5A;
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 30px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #e8f5ef;
        }

        h2:first-of-type {
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            color: #34495e;
        }

        ul {
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            padding-left: 25px;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: #34495e;
        }

        .highlight {
            background: #fff8e1;
            border-left: 4px solid #f9a825;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .contact-box {
            background: #f0f7f3;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .contact-box a {
            color: #2E7D5A;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .contact-box a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #2c3e50;
            color: #bdc3c7;
            padding: 25px 40px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .footer strong {
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                margin: 10px auto;
            }
            .header {
                padding: 35px 20px;
            }
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .content {
                padding: 25px 20px;
            }
            h2 {
                font-size: 1.25rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
            <div class="app-name">Home Mend</div>
            <div class="tagline">Fix it. Mend it. Maintain it.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="effective-date">Effective Date: September 1, 2026</div>

            <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
            <p>Welcome to <strong>Home Mend</strong>, a free offline home repair and maintenance guide app developed by Daynix Studio. This Privacy Policy explains how our application handles your information.</p>
            <p>By installing and using Home Mend, you agree to the terms described in this policy.</p>

            <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
            <div class="highlight">
                <strong>Home Mend does NOT collect, store, or share any personal information.</strong>
            </div>
            <p>The app is fully offline and operates entirely on your device. Specifically:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>No name, email, phone number, or personal identifiers are collected.</li>
                <li>No account creation or login is required.</li>
                <li>No location data is accessed or stored.</li>
                <li>No contacts, photos, or files are accessed.</li>
                <li>No usage analytics or tracking tools are integrated.</li>
                <li>No advertising SDKs are included in the app.</li>
            </ul>

            <h2>3. Data Stored on Your Device</h2>
            <p>To provide app functionality, Home Mend saves the following data <strong>only on your own device</strong> using local storage:</p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your favorite repair guides</li>
                <li>Recently viewed guides</li>
                <li>Your personal Fix List (To Fix / Fixed items)</li>
                <li>Your app settings (theme mode, font size)</li>
            </ul>
            <p>This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted to us or any third party. You can clear all of this data at any time from the Settings screen using the "Reset App Data" option.</p>

            <h2>4. Internet Connection</h2>
            <p>Home Mend does not require an internet connection to function. All repair guides, categories, and emergency actions are stored within the app and work fully offline.</p>

            <h2>5. Permissions</h2>
            <p>Home Mend does not request any sensitive permissions such as camera, microphone, location, contacts, or storage access.</p>

            <h2>6. Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>Home Mend does not integrate with any third-party services, analytics platforms, or advertising networks. Your usage of the app remains completely private.</p>

            <h2>7. Children's Privacy</h2>
            <p>Home Mend is safe for all ages. Because the app collects no personal information whatsoever, it complies with privacy laws concerning children, including the Children's Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA) and the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>

            <h2>8. Safety Disclaimer</h2>
            <div class="highlight">
                Home Mend provides general home repair guidance for informational purposes only. For serious plumbing, electrical, gas, or structural issues, always consult a qualified professional. Use all tools and materials at your own risk. Daynix Studio is not liable for any damage, injury, or loss resulting from following the guides in this app.
            </div>

            <h2>9. Changes to This Privacy Policy</h2>
            <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page along with a revised "Effective Date". We encourage you to review this policy periodically.</p>

            <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or the Home Mend app, please contact us:</p>
            <div class="contact-box">
                <p>📧 <a href="mailto:shahzadalivc76@gmail.com">shahzadalivc76@gmail.com</a></p>
                <p style="margin-top: 8px;">Daynix Studio</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p><strong>© 2026 Daynix Studio</strong> — All rights reserved.</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 6px;">Home Mend — Your offline home repair companion.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
